# Mel IQ API documentation

Machine-oriented overview of Mel IQ public APIs for agents.

## Base URLs

- Platform API: `https://api.mel.iq/api/v1`
- Marketing / discovery site: `https://www.mel.iq`

## Specs and catalogs

- OpenAPI: [/docs/openapi.json](https://www.mel.iq/docs/openapi.json)
- API catalog (RFC 9727): [/.well-known/api-catalog](https://www.mel.iq/.well-known/api-catalog)
- ARD manifest: [/.well-known/ai-catalog.json](https://www.mel.iq/.well-known/ai-catalog.json)
- Auth guide: [/auth.md](https://www.mel.iq/auth.md)
- MCP server card: [/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json](https://www.mel.iq/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json)

## Auth

Merchants authenticate with Iraqi phone OTP. Agents should follow `/auth.md`.
Protected API calls use `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.

## Public MCP tools

`POST https://www.mel.iq/api/mcp` exposes read-only discovery tools:

- `get_mel_overview`
- `get_app_download_links`
- `get_pricing_entry_points`
- `get_support_contacts`

